  "body": "## v1.42.3\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* updating generated files post 1.42.2 release by @acornett21 in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7072\r\n* Bump github.com/go-jose/go-jose/v4 from 4.1.3 to 4.1.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7076\r\n* Bump go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk from 1.40.0 to 1.43.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7083\r\n* Bump github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 from 5.16.5 to 5.17.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7075\r\n* Bump github.com/distribution/distribution/v3 from 3.0.0 to 3.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7078\r\n* Bump go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp from 1.42.0 to 1.43.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7082\r\n* Bump go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetrichttp from 1.42.0 to 1.43.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7081\r\n* Bump go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp from 0.18.0 to 0.19.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7080\r\n* Bump github.com/moby/spdystream from 0.5.0 to 0.5.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7086\r\n* Bump github.com/distribution/distribution/v3 from 3.1.0 to 3.1.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7092\r\n* Bump github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 from 5.17.1 to 5.19.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7093\r\n* Bump github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 from 5.19.0 to 5.19.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7094\r\n* Bump github.com/containerd/containerd from 1.7.29 to 1.7.32 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7099\r\n* updating ansible operator plugin version to 1.42.3 and other dependen… by @acornett21 in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7106\r\n* Bump ubi9/ubi-minimal from 9.7 to 9.8 in /images/helm-operator by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7098\r\n* Bump ubi9/ubi-minimal from 9.7 to 9.8 in /images/operator-sdk by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7097\r\n* Bump ubi9/ubi-minimal from 9.7 to 9.8 in /images/scorecard-test by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7096\r\n* Bump ubi9/ubi-minimal from 9.7 to 9.8 in /images/custom-scorecard-tests by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7095\r\n* Bump github.com/containerd/containerd from 1.7.32 to 1.7.33 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7105\r\n* updating images to ubi 9.8 by @acornett21 in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7107\r\n* Release v1.42.3 by @acornett21 in https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/pull/7108\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/operator-framework/operator-sdk/compare/v1.42.2...v1.42.3",
